      "statement": "`help` lists `next-free <clinician> <time>` directly after `schedule <clinician> <date>`. Acceptance criteria: each statement above holds; the standing requirements in `README.md` hold; existing behaviour is unchanged except as these requirements say; `dotnet test Clinic.slnx` passes.",
